'''Cala Maria''' (イカ天, ''Ika Ten'') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Calamary]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[The Aku Realms]]. She was added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]].

